{"id":1292265,"slug":"g-binin-kouzeln-domek-s-rie-1-2021","title":"Gábinin kouzelný domek- Série 1","title_en":null,"year":2021,"rating":50,"votes_count":10,"runtime_min":240,"age_rating":null,"title_type":"série","vod_date":"2021-01-05","plot":null,"poster":"https://image.pmgstatic.com/cache/resized/w140/files/images/film/posters/164/911/164911031_d16a53.jpg","backdrop":null,"trailer_youtube_id":null,"genres":["Animovaný","Dobrodružný","Fantasy","Komedie","Rodinný"],"tags":[],"countries":["USA"],"directors":["Kevin Peaty","Mandy Clotworthy","Dan Riba"],"actors":["Laila Lockhart Kraner","Sainty Nelsen","Maggie Lowe","Secunda Wood","Tara Strong"],"screenwriters":["Gilli Nissim","Clark Stubbs","Natalie Barbrie","Traci Paige Johnson","Jennifer Twomey","Matt Fleckenstein","Steven Sullivan","Scott Gray"],"cinematographers":[],"composers":["P.T. Walkley"],"reviews":[{"author":"Veruska.Kuru","text":"Můj syn to miluje, protože jsou tam kočky – a pro něj je to úplně top 🐱💖. Barevné, hravé, všechno zpívá a bliká… takže dítě nadšené, já občas přemýšlím, kolik kočičích písniček zvládnu přežít, než mi z toho rupne v hlavě 😅. Ale musím uznat, že je to milé, roztomilé a pro děti fakt skvělá volba. Takže jo, kouzelný domek splnil účel – udělal radost malému i když dospělý trpí trochu víc 🙃.(17.08.2025)","stars":3}],"vods":[{"platform":"Prime Video","url":"https://www.primevideo.com/detail/amzn1.dv.gti.e8a904f8-2a06-452e-82ea-d05b46df4a06"}],"link":"https://www.csfd.cz/film/900832-gabinin-kouzelny-domek/931056-serie-1/prehled/","csfd_id":931056,"root_id":900832,"root_title_id":47409,"root_title":"Gábinin kouzelný domek","root_slug":"g-binin-kouzeln-domek-2021","is_toplevel":false,"season_no":1,"episode_no":null}